@comment
No change list here on purpose. The forum post is only a Steam unfurl card, and the
Steam API serves just the ~16 most recent notes, so this body can no longer be
refetched. Regenerating from the post cache would fill it with the unfurl blurb
("store.steampowered.com"), which is why regenerate-from-cache.ts skips it.
@end

